  "body": "Currently it's unspecified which mimetypes and characteristics should actually supported by the m.audio/m.video/m.image msgtypes.  This is a major interoperability shortcoming - I need to know which formats my client should be able to accept & render. E.g. do we speak MP3 or AAC for audio?\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SPEC-169)\n\n(Reported by @ara4n)\n",
